{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.73608245849609377,"x":0.068041244872015058,"y":0.09738372082111646,"h":0.033561669583188958,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.063738672456516293,"w":0.38177607218424481,"h":0.023786633279277325,"y":0.16224862441862609,"c":1},{"w":0.21443298339843753,"y":0.20199647695479028,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","x":0.063917528816245198},{"y":0.23982558156268596,"h":0.015988371754420694,"w":0.85773193359374988,"x":0.063917538252898212,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band &.5 score. Here is the"},{"t":"examiner's comment:","y":0.25654839057963752,"h":0.016779370960318563,"x":0.06377446449223205,"c":1,"w":0.21891316731770832},{"w":0.82886596679687496,"x":0.1154639237541689,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089666,"y":0.29505813925832625,"t":"The candidate covers all the data in the charts, but there is some inaccuracy in his"},{"h":0.017615971814445075,"w":0.81855672200520835,"y":0.31385789778530737,"x":0.11340205124672499,"t":"description (the largest percentage went with the Agricultural and farms) (not true","c":1},{"y":0.3313953485601917,"x":0.11340206439815299,"w":0.84536081949869801,"h":0.017441861012089888,"t":"in all cases) and there is a shortage of data to support the descriptions. There is an","c":1},{"t":"attempt to summarise the main points at the end of the description. Information is","h":0.01923474744706033,"c":1,"x":0.11332984779885104,"y":0.34878422106336093,"w":0.81869481404622402},{"x":0.11340206436923618,"w":0.84536081949869779,"c":1,"y":0.3690546093020457,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"evident, but it is not arranged coherently (the description jumps from different usage"},{"h":0.017441861012089777,"w":0.80000000000000004,"t":"in general to specific use in different countries, but this does not follow a logical","y":0.38808139507309702,"c":1,"x":0.11134020608274056},{"t":"sequence). Without reference back to the individual charts, it is hard to follow the","x":0.11340206501086754,"h":0.019083969465648831,"c":1,"w":0.8144329833984375,"y":0.40546095154260442},{"c":1,"t":"description, especially where reference is also unclear (it, them, they). The range","x":0.11340205807133334,"y":0.42441860437521939,"w":0.81649485270182298,"h":0.017448688491400244},{"t":"of lexis is just adequate for the task (largest percentage, greatest number, a lot, the","x":0.11134019690622655,"y":0.44331395332969614,"c":1,"h":0.018895349149765539,"w":0.84123713175455717},{"y":0.45977681017298355,"h":0.020348679368382583,"c":1,"w":0.83104395548502608,"t":"second after Asia), but there is reliance on input material and errors in spelling are","x":0.11128091407816744},{"w":0.82268040974934886,"h":0.017441861012089777,"c":1,"y":0.48110465088671617,"t":"noticeable, even where the lexis is supplied in the prompt or the diagrams. A very","x":0.11134020739703772},{"w":0.8453608194986979,"y":0.49853200239825424,"h":0.017456369965621055,"t":"limited range of structures is used and grammatical errors are frequent (... all of pie","x":0.10927835305502394,"c":1},{"t":"charts have the got ..., ... they almost the second after Asia use water in industrial","x":0.11340205443768696,"y":0.51732237202090925,"w":0.83298970540364592,"h":0.017615971814445186,"c":1},{"w":0.82474227905273445,"c":1,"x":0.11134020059263917,"y":0.53633720902591231,"t":"and opposite of Europe, ... they slightly same in industrial use,... South Asia and","h":0.017441861012089777},{"c":1,"y":0.55519671180021168,"t":"South America are uses the water in Agricultural rather than industrial). The script","x":0.1134020630509472,"w":0.82268040974934886,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"t":"represents a mixed profile, but overall achieves Band 4.5.","x":0.10918969508713142,"w":0.58571980794270839,"h":0.019914612515282037,"y":0.57260955402394786,"c":1},{"t":"The charts indi.cate to Five places on the earth. Takking about water and the ways","y":0.61186142075910221,"w":0.851546376546224,"c":1,"x":0.061855677591752853,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"y":0.62902948563297112,"w":0.1239117431640625,"c":1,"t":"of using it.","h":0.019557307764704102,"x":0.059693612852938192},{"x":0.059793795992788334,"t":"It seen abvious all of pie charts have the got the Lavest precentage in the domestic","h":0.020348836167448092,"w":0.88247426350911451,"c":1,"y":0.65552325633108421},{"w":0.84123713175455728,"y":0.67439812093070339,"h":0.01891583270769015,"t":"uses like at home. However, the Largest precentage went wit.h the Agricuttural ard","c":1,"x":0.059793805236259913},{"c":1,"h":0.019083969465648831,"t":"farms. The center of Asia has the greatest numbers of precentage of Agricittural","x":0.05979382558963342,"y":0.69318849055715059,"w":0.83505152384440107},{"h":0.019834745791262209,"c":1,"w":0.87020019531249992,"t":"use. On the other hand in Europe they did not use, water so much as central Asia or","x":0.059746583799278975,"y":0.71059998275247427},{"t":"Africa. They just use 32,4%. But in the industral they use it alot. and the Largest","x":0.061801610710298951,"y":0.7296266635106875,"c":1,"w":0.87225392659505219,"h":0.020208675722759417},{"t":"precentage with them. If we check on Africa, it seen they alost the second after","x":0.061855688705333214,"c":1,"w":0.85567006429036463,"y":0.74709302352238072,"h":0.02037614832467638},{"h":0.018069261112985902,"t":"Asia use water in industrial and opposite of Europe.","y":0.76595001117340811,"c":1,"x":0.061771504277541994,"w":0.53831832885742181},{"x":0.061779196778140789,"c":1,"y":0.79335616845192125,"w":0.79806737263997407,"h":0.020208088846257133,"t":"In North America and Europe they stightly same in industrial use and just less"},{"y":0.8103918464429275,"h":0.021514619299753623,"c":1,"x":0.061766458740781523,"w":0.81873392740885409,"t":"A precentages to Europe, Sauth Asia and Sauth America ore uses the waker in"},{"t":"Agricitturat. rather than industrial.","x":0.061855674181018165,"y":0.83139534855786956,"w":0.35257731119791663,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089777},{"h":0.018895349149765539,"c":1,"x":0.061855659512255648,"y":0.85610465084905141,"w":0.88041239420572925,"t":"Overall, they all use water much in the form and Agricuttural. Europe and North America"},{"h":0.0220690831953263,"w":0.80838689168294275,"x":0.05971972531748785,"y":0.87362280667719239,"c":1,"t":"they use water more than others in the industri.al areas. Africa got the lowest."},{"w":0.43759236653645833,"c":1,"y":0.89292081971730397,"x":0.059538987891476249,"t":"precentage in domestic and industrial uses.","h":0.022235912921074519},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.95784883720083303,"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343103,"t":"132","x":0.061855670862263165},{"h":0.024146245216105311,"y":0.95282602791095983,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35211882393593585,"c":1,"w":0.29363896687825519}]}